            "review_title": "Review at Bia Thủ Công Cậu Hai",
            "review_text": "Ferb Z\n1 contribution\n1\nA great craft beer spot\nApr 2024 • Friends\nMy friend invited me here. I was a bit skeptical because craft beer usually costs over 100,000 VND per glass, but here it's only 25,000 VND, and I didn't get a headache after drinking it. The salmon belly was quite unusual because it's usually eaten with hotpot, but here it was grilled and marinated with chili salt, which was unique and delicious.\nWritten July 26, 2024",
