            "review_title": "Review at Bia Thủ Công Cậu Hai",
            "review_text": "Cong N\n2 contributions\n1\n10 points for service!\nJun 2024 • Friends\nI came across the brand Cậu Hai Beer through a trade networking event and decided to visit the place. The traditional beer paired with sausages and cheese was delicious. But more importantly, the servers were friendly. We ended up talking about learning English, and the servers advised me about their university, which was helpful for me to consider for my child. 10 points for service!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 25, 2024\nAGROTECT Vietnam\nThank you for visiting Uncle Hai Craft Beer and leaving this wonderful review! We are delighted to hear that you had an enjoyable experience with our service. We hope that you and your child will make great decisions for the future and we look forward to welcoming you back next time!\nRead more\nWritten July 26, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
